---
// ProblemFricciones.astro — Tres puntos del problema en hora punta, sin cajas pesadas
---

<div class="friction-list" role="list">
  <article class="friction-item" role="listitem" data-reveal="card" data-reveal-delay="1">
    <div class="friction-icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path>
        <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline>
        <line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line>
        <line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="friction-copy">
      <h3 class="friction-heading">Un formulario por DeCA.</h3>
      <p class="friction-text">Cuarenta cargas son cuarenta formularios.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="friction-item" role="listitem" data-reveal="card" data-reveal-delay="2">
    <div class="friction-icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <rect x="2" y="6" width="20" height="12" rx="2"></rect>
        <path d="M6 12h12"></path>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="friction-copy">
      <h3 class="friction-heading">La matrícula, repetida.</h3>
      <p class="friction-text">La misma, en cada albarán del mismo camión.</p>
    </div>
  </article>

  <article class="friction-item" role="listitem" data-reveal="card" data-reveal-delay="3">
    <div class="friction-icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle>
        <polyline points="12 7 12 12 15 15"></polyline>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="friction-copy">
      <h3 class="friction-heading">El camión esperando.</h3>
      <p class="friction-text">Sin DeCA no sale, y el conductor necesita su copia antes de arrancar.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</div>

<style>
  .friction-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 100%;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle, var(--palette-slate-200));
  }

  .friction-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1.125rem;
    padding-block: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle, var(--palette-slate-200));
  }

  .friction-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    color: var(--color-brand-primary, var(--palette-emerald-700));
    margin-top: 0.125rem;
  }

  .friction-copy {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .friction-heading {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.35;
    color: var(--color-text-primary, var(--palette-slate-900));
    margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
  }

  .friction-text {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary, var(--palette-slate-600));
    margin: 0;
  }
</style>
